WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.170
Crouching medium punch punishes Ryu after his blocked OD Shoryuken.

2
00:00:01.170 --> 00:00:01.720
Back heavy punch cancels into OD Renversé.

3
00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:02.240
The Renversé kick follow-up launches Ryu.

4
00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:02.810
Back heavy punch catches Ryu in the air.

5
00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:04.500
Heavy Rond-point keeps the juggle going.

6
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:05.950
Light Renversé catches Ryu to end the juggle.

7
00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:07.050
Ryu lands from Renversé and the medal counter shows two.
